(7839185, 1313615, 50695, '<td valign="top">
Brent and Steve have been hauling lumber for twenty years. Brent is single, Steve''s been married 3 times. I talk about them like they''re friends, but they''ve said about 5 words to each other in all that time. Just two guys who happen to have the same unusual job hauling for the same people on the same shift. 
<br/>
<br/>One day, Steve hears the cart behind him hesitate. He looks back to see Brent twisting in his seat. Steve stops his horses. He can feel something is wrong. Brent stands up and then tumbles to the street. Steve has already leapt off his cart and is bending over him. He''s... not moving... not breathing. 
<br/>
<br/>"Brent," Steve whispers. "Brent!" he shouts. He cups Brent''s head in his hands. The beep of a car startles him. In a sudden rage he runs over to the car and starts pounding on the windshield. The driver pushes him over with the door. Steve is sobbing, sobbing. Everything he has ever lost looms above him like the logs on his cart.</td>', 'Brent and Steve have been hauling lumber for twenty years. Brent is single, Steve''s been married 3 times. I talk about them like they''re friends, but they''ve said about 5 words to each other in all that time. Just two guys who happen to have the same unusual job hauling for the same people on the same shift. 

One day, Steve hears the cart behind him hesitate. He looks back to see Brent twisting in his seat. Steve stops his horses. He can feel something is wrong. Brent stands up and then tumbles to the street. Steve has already leapt off his cart and is bending over him. He''s... not moving... not breathing. 

"Brent," Steve whispers. "Brent!" he shouts. He cups Brent''s head in his hands. The beep of a car startles him. In a sudden rage he runs over to the car and starts pounding on the windshield. The driver pushes him over with the door. Steve is sobbing, sobbing. Everything he has ever lost looms above him like the logs on his cart.', '2026-09-30 18:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
